            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't see an entry for compatible type https://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/75805044e932207052a2c2c51585f1f9c5189401/configurations/meta/yv5/yosemite5_medusa_board_discrete.json#L1818 in PDI https://github.com/openbmc/entity-manager/blob/75805044e932207052a2c2c51585f1f9c5189401/configurations/meta/yv5/yosemite5_medusa_board_discrete.json#L1818. Please add it and share the gerrit here.\n\nAlso for future please add relevant links all 3 related PRs (if any) -\n1. EM Schema Change.\n2. EM Config.\n3. PDI change which adds the compatible string."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Are you going to add the update support later on?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "LeoYangQuanta",
                        "email": "Leo-Yang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "LeoYangQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi Jagpal,\n\nPlease refer to the following link:\n\n86487: com.meta: yosemite5: add compatible strings for HSC/VR | https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/+/86487\n\n86566: schemas: firmware: add XDP71XFirmware support | https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/86566\n\n86567: configurations: yosemite5: add medusa XDP71x, RAA228006 FW config | https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/86567"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "LeoYangQuanta",
                        "email": "Leo-Yang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "LeoYangQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi @paligill@gmail.com,\n\nThere are currently no plans to support updates. Due to the architecture of our project, operations on the XDP710 must be routed through a CPLD. Currently, the CPLD only supports reading registers, so we are unable to test updates on our platform.\n\nTherefore, we have chosen to leave this feature empty for now. If there is a need in the future or if other developers require it, they can implement it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "@Leo-Yang@quantatw.com Thanks.\nCan you please add these details to PR comment description for future PRs."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "LeoYangQuanta",
                        "email": "Leo-Yang@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "LeoYangQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, I'll keep that in mind. Thanks."
                },
